# Model weights are NOT versioned in git. They live on HF Hub (Shota2811/ps26094-signals, private)
# or are bind-mounted into the scoring container as /models (see docker-compose.yml).
# Heavy weight files (.safetensors, .joblib, .pkl) are blocked by root .gitignore.
# Tiny metadata files (config.json, calibration.json, tokenizer configs) ARE versioned here
# so label maps and calibration temperatures stay in sync with the codebase.
*
!.gitignore
!REGISTRY.md
# allow model metadata (not weights — those are caught by root .gitignore)
!*/
!*/config.json
!*/calibration.json
!*/tokenizer_config.json
!*/tokenizer.json
!*/special_tokens_map.json
!*/metrics.json
!*/metrics_ravdess.json
!*/README.md
